.source{content="# A4 competitor: code + formal docs + schema + rules\n\nTraditional stack with the same Storage.write contract as LIN, but the\nrules are not bound to a compiler, semantic hash, or proof-before-change gate.\n\nThis group exists to kill: \"it is not LIN, it is just having metadata.\"\n"}
